{'symbol': 'DVA', 'date': '2021-03-23 08:00:00', 'title': 'DAVITA KIDNEY CARE EXPANDS USE OF NXSTAGE HOME HEMODIALYSIS MACHINES FROM FRESENIUS MEDICAL CARE', 'text': 'WALTHAM, MASS. AND DENVER, MARCH 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 FRESENIUS MEDICAL CARE NORTH AMERICA\xa0(FMCNA) AND DAVITA KIDNEY CARE TODAY ANNOUNCED AN EXPANDED AGREEMENT TO PROVIDE HOME DIALYSIS TECHNOLOGY—INCLUDING NXSTAGE HOME HEMODIALYSIS (HHD) MACHINES, DIALYSIS SUPPLIES, AND A CONNECTED HEALTH PLATFORM—TO DAVITA PATIENTS ACROSS THE UNITED STATES.'}